Goety (NeoForge 26.1 port)

This module is a derived work of Goety by Polarice3 (https://github.com/Polarice3/Goety-2, branch 1.20, version 2.5.59.2),
licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Taken from upstream: textures, block and item models, blockstates, sounds, recipe patterns, item and block lists and
tuning values. Java code is a new implementation on the 26.1 API that follows the behaviour of the original.
Display names are rewritten in Diaithiris (names_map.json holds the English original of each name).
Patchouli (CC-BY-NC-SA) and JEI integrations of the original are not carried over.
